      ],
      "source": "https://www.northoaksmn.gov/298/History-of-North-Oaks",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pleasant Lake, the heart of North Oaks, once supplied water to Saint Paul’s municipal system and still holds water‑access rights.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
